 ## How to apply in a new app                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  1. Pick ONE object as the source of truth — a list of                                                                                                                                                    
     {role, content, timestamp} dicts, attached to your request/session                                                                                                                                    
     state. Don't scatter history across multiple variables.                                                                                                                                               
  2. Never let code index the list directly. Expose exactly 3 methods:                                                                                                                                     
     append(), get_raw(), get_plain().                                                                                                                                                                     
  3. Convert external -> internal format once, at the door (ingest).                                                                                                                                       
     Nothing downstream should know the external shape.                                                                                                                                                    
  4. Every producer of a "turn" (tool call, sub-agent, fallback, etc.)                                                                                                                                     
     just calls append() — nothing more. Cheap and decoupled.                                                                                                                                              
  5. Clean on a COPY, only at the LLM boundary. Keep raw history intact                                                                                                                                    
     for UI transcript/audits. Never persist the cleaned version as if                                                                                                                                     
     it were the source of truth.                                                                                                                                                                          
  6. Persist the raw notebook (not the cleaned copy) between turns,                                                                                                                                        
     keyed by conversation ID, so context survives stateless requests.  


## Flow                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                      
  │ 1. INGEST (start of a request)                                  │                                                                                                                                      
  │    External format (UI/API payload)                             │                                                                                                                                      
  │        │                                                         │                                                                                                                                     
  │        ▼  convert()                                              │                                                                                                                                     
  │    Internal format  →  seeded into the "notebook"                │                                                                                                                                     
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘                                                                                                                                      
                                │                                                                                                                                                                          
                                ▼                                                                                                                                                                          
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                      
  │ 2. THE NOTEBOOK (single source of truth, in memory)              │                                                                                                                                     
  │                                                                   │                                                                                                                                    
  │    history = [ {role, content, timestamp}, ... ]                 │                                                                                                                                     
  │                                                                   │                                                                                                                                    
  │    Only 3 doors in/out:                                          │                                                                                                                                     
  │      - append(entry)      <- every stage that produces a turn    │                                                                                                                                     
  │      - read_raw()         <- full history w/ timestamps          │                                                                                                                                     
  │      - read_plain()       <- clean {role, content} pairs         │                                                                                                                                     
  │                                                                   │                                                                                                                                    
  │    Nothing else is allowed to touch the list directly.           │                                                                                                                                     
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘                                                                                                                                      
         ▲               ▲                 ▲                ▲                                                                                                                                              
         │ append        │ append          │ append         │ append                                                                                                                                       
    ┌────┴────┐   ┌──────┴─────┐   ┌───────┴──────┐  ┌──────┴──────┐                                                                                                                                       
    │ Planner │   │ Tool call  │   │ Web search   │  │ Fallback /  │                                                                                                                                       
    │ turn    │   │ result     │   │ result       │  │ any stage   │                                                                                                                                       
    └─────────┘   └────────────┘   └──────────────┘  └─────────────┘   
                                   
                               │                                                                                                                                                                          
                                ▼                                                                                                                                                                          
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                      
  │ 3. CONSUME (right before an LLM call — never before)             │                                                                                                                                     
  │                                                                   │                                                                                                                                    
  │    read_raw() / read_plain()                                     │                                                                                                                                     
  │        │                                                          │                                                                                                                                    
  │        ▼  make a COPY, don't mutate original                     │                                                                                                                                     
  │    clean_for_prompt(copy):                                       │                                                                                                                                     
  │      - strip noise (widgets/citations -> plain text)             │                                                                                                                                     
  │      - merge consecutive same-role turns                         │                                                                                                                                     
  │      - trim to last N user turns (token budget)                  │                                                                                                                                     
  │        │                                                          │                                                                                                                                    
  │        ▼                                                          │                                                                                                                                    
  │    Prompt sent to LLM                                            │                                                                                                                                     
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘                                                                                                                                      
                                │                                                                                                                                                                          
                                ▼                                                                                                                                                                          
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                      
  │ 4. PERSIST (end of request, across turns)                        │                                                                                                                                     
  │    Notebook (session/context state) saved to cache/DB,           │                                                                                                                                     
  │    keyed by conversation_id.                                      │                                                                                                                                    
  │    Next request: reload it, go back to step 2.                    │                                                                                                                                    
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  
  
                                   
    ## Core idea                                                                                                                                                                                             
  One shared "notebook" that every part of the pipeline can write a line                                                                                                                                   
  into (in one agreed format), but nobody touches directly — they call                                                                                                                                     
  a write function instead. Before talking to the LLM, take a *copy*,                                                                                                                                      
  clean it up, and send the copy. The original stays untouched.                                                                                          Jump to bottom (ctrl+End) ↓ 


